{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 42, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make thy way to the airport, where thou shalt board a plane bound for the land of the rising sun, Japan.\n\nUpon arrival in Tokyo, the bustling capital city, thou shalt embark upon a tour of the city's historic sites, including the ancient Senso-ji Temple and the majestic Meiji Shrine.\n\nThe following day, thou shalt venture to the nearby city of Yokohama, where thou shalt stroll along the picturesque harbor and explore the charming Chinatown district.\n\nOn the third day of thy journey, thou shalt visit the scenic mountain town of Hakone, where thou shalt ride a cable car to the top of Mount Fuji and soak in a traditional onsen, or hot spring, to relax and rejuvenate.\n\nThe fourth day shall be spent in the cultural capital of Kyoto, where thou shalt marvel at the gold-leafed Kinkaku-ji Temple and the intricate rock gardens of Ryoan-ji.\n\nOn the fifth day, thou shalt journey to the historic city of Nara, where thou shalt commune with the sacred deer that roam freely in the park surrounding Todai-ji Temple.\n\nThe final day of thy trip shall be spent in the modern metropolis of Osaka, where thou shalt indulge in the city's famous street food and take in the bright lights and bustling energy of Dotonbori, the entertainment district.\n\nAs the sun sets on thy final day in Japan, thou shalt reflect on the memories thou hast made and the wonders thou hast seen, knowing that thou hast truly experienced the beauty and wonder of this amazing country.\n\nBut alas, all good things must come to an end, and so it is with a heavy heart that thou shalt board thy plane and bid farewell to Japan, knowing that thou wilt carry the spirit of this fascinating land with thee always.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "bre